# 换行策略。这台机器 core.autocrlf=true，不加这条的话检出时 .sh 会被换成 CRLF，
# Git Bash 里 `bash host/scripts/sign-apk.sh` 会因 `\r` 报错；而仓库里所有源件实测是 LF。
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.tsv text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.so binary
